    "Template for the manifest.json inside a Betty OS starter-pack ZIP.",
    "Place this file at the archive root. 'path' is the member path inside the",
    "ZIP, exactly as stored. Any file not described here still imports, using",
    "the default category chosen in the UI, so the manifest is optional but",
    "strongly preferred: it is what assigns locked status to official marks.",
    "Import with Library > Illustration Studio > Brand Asset Vault >",
    "'Bootstrap from a starter-pack ZIP'. Nothing here is committed to git -",
    "binaries land under BETTY_OS_DATA_DIR."
